{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01Tgovrh6ewDpJR2qJTWXmcx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two things — let me clear up the confusion first, then fix the name.\n\n**On `SendUserFile`:** it's the tool I'd been using to attach files **into this same chat** so they show up for you to view/download — it's how all those images and the earlier video cuts reached you. There's no other chat; it attaches right here. It just got **disabled** when the tool list reconnected a moment ago, so this turn I could only give you the file path instead of attaching the MP4 inline. When it comes back, I'll attach it here as before.\n\n**On the name — important catch:** I've been writing **\"Ineed AI\"** everywhere, including the parts **burned into the video** (the end slate and the spoken narration line \"This is how Ineed AI ships\"). That's wrong — it's **Kneaded.ai**. That needs a fix + re-render so the slate text and the voice are correct. Fixing it now:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1240,"cache_read_input_tokens":570871,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1240},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8372a238-b04e-409c-9415-57d1f26ec648","uuid":"352f9a8c-4bf9-4e8f-a8c7-07bd82acc995","request_id":"req_011Cbbn2w71bVcehoARNdGgN"}
