{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01So2As92fHQxtJTSVQTxmJv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"On it — spawning both, as a head-to-head: **Antigravity (Gemini)** and **Codex** each get the committed shot package and try to generate the 8 motion shots with whatever video-gen they actually have. I'm instructing both to be honest — if they have no video tool, report it rather than fake clips — and to write to engine-specific folders so we can compare (a real tribe bake-off, fittingly)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":654,"cache_read_input_tokens":590196,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":654},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8372a238-b04e-409c-9415-57d1f26ec648","uuid":"3edd30fb-a69d-4421-b305-d54a192857da","request_id":"req_011CbboGZv43WPEQnA2NbNvk"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01So2As92fHQxtJTSVQTxmJv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01M1AWsx8SNRDDZs1sx9kErs","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > /tmp/ccc_spawn_motion.py <<'PY'\nimport json, time, urllib.request, urllib.error\nCCC=\"http://127.0.0.1:8090\"; REPO=\"/Users/amirfish/Apps/video-claw\"\n\ndef prompt_for(eng):\n    return f\"\"\"You are the {eng} agent. Phase 2 of a film: generate MOTION shots.\n\nRepo: /Users/amirfish/Apps/video-claw (branch main). Read this shot package fully:\n  docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-30-review-room-phase2-shots.md\n\nIt lists 8 image-to-video shots (1,2,3,4,6,8,9,10). Each has a SEED still at\nreview-room/stills/shot_NN.png, a camera move, a duration, a prompt, and global\nstyle + negative prompts.\n\nYour job: using whatever real VIDEO-GENERATION capability you have (e.g. Veo or any\nimage-to-video / text-to-video tool), generate a 16:9 motion clip for each of those\n8 shots, seeded by the corresponding still as the first frame, and save them to\n  review-room/motion/{eng}/shot_NN.mp4\n\nCRITICAL HONESTY: If you do NOT actually have a working video-generation tool, DO NOT\nfabricate clips, DO NOT create fake/placeholder mp4s, and DO NOT pretend you did.\nJust report plainly which video capability you have (or that you have none) and stop.\nWe are genuinely testing what each engine can do. Do not commit anything (the media\ndir is gitignored). When done or blocked, report: the capability you found, which\nshots you generated with their paths, and any blockers.\"\"\"\n\ndef spawn(eng):\n    req=urllib.request.Request(CCC+\"/api/sessions/spawn\",\n        data=json.dumps({\"prompt\":prompt_for(eng),\"engine\":eng,\"repo_path\":REPO}).encode(),\n        headers={\"Content-Type\":\"application/json\"})\n    try:\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req,timeout=60) as r: return json.loads(r.read().decode())\n    except urllib.error.HTTPError as e: return {\"_http\":e.code,\"_body\":e.read().decode()[:300]}\n\ndef spawned_list():\n    try:\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(CCC+\"/api/sessions/spawned\",timeout=20) as r:\n            d=json.loads(r.read().decode())\n        return d if isinstance(d,list) else d.get(\"spawned\",d.get(\"sessions\",[]))\n    except Exception: return []\n\nresp={}\nfor eng in (\"antigravity\",\"codex\"):\n    r=spawn(eng); resp[eng]=r\n    print(f\"spawn {eng}: spawn_id={r.get('spawn_id')} pid={r.get('pid')} cwd={r.get('cwd')} ok={r.get('ok')}\")\n\n# resolve session ids\ntime.sleep(6)\nsl=spawned_list()\nfor eng in (\"antigravity\",\"codex\"):\n    sid=resp[eng].get(\"spawn_id\")\n    match=[s for s in sl if str(s.get(\"spawn_id\"))==str(sid) or s.get(\"pid\")==resp[eng].get(\"pid\")]\n    if match:\n        print(f\"{eng} session_id -> {match[0].get('session_id')}  log={match[0].get('log')}\")\n        resp[eng][\"session_id\"]=match[0].get(\"session_id\"); resp[eng][\"log\"]=match[0].get(\"log\")\njson.dump(resp, open(\"/tmp/ccc_motion_spawns.json\",\"w\"))\nPY\npython3 /tmp/ccc_spawn_motion.py","description":"Spawn Antigravity + Codex agents for motion generation, resolve session ids"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":654,"cache_read_input_tokens":590196,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":654},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8372a238-b04e-409c-9415-57d1f26ec648","uuid":"c6f7d0e7-4ab6-42e4-8261-203e3796fefc","request_id":"req_011CbboGZv43WPEQnA2NbNvk"}
