{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_013om9F5FGh2mr1T26H7k8kX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Clear result from the bake-off — and it resolved the cost worry on its own:\n\n- **Antigravity (Gemini): no video capability.** It thoroughly checked (built-in tools, env keys, `gcloud`, pip/npm, the video_claw codebase) and **honestly reported \"Shots Generated: None\"** with **no fake files** — exactly the behavior I asked for. Notably, it *didn't* think to use the fal key.\n- **Codex: found the real path** (fal `FAL_API_KEY` → Kling 3.0 Pro image-to-video) and is generating. So **only Codex is spending fal credits — no double-bill.**\n\nSo Codex is the lone generator. Two things:\n\n**Cost heads-up:** 8 Kling 3.0 Pro image-to-video jobs is real fal spend (likely a few to ~$10–15 depending on durations). You saw Codex's plan and didn't object, so I'll let it run — but if you'd rather **validate quality on 2–3 hero shots first** (1, 9, 10) before paying for all 8, say so and I'll inject that into Codex now.\n\n**Prep so re-assembly is instant:** I'm adding a `clip` handler to the assembler that **auto-upgrades** any shot with a motion clip in `review-room/motion/codex/` and falls back to the Ken-Burns still otherwise — so a single re-run swaps in however many clips Codex finishes, with audio/captions/slate untouched. Adding that now:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3029,"cache_read_input_tokens":596702,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3029},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8372a238-b04e-409c-9415-57d1f26ec648","uuid":"de1d27b0-d5d4-49f8-8a52-2a66ea1e65e9","request_id":"req_011Cbbp5T575oYupHLtRG7Wa"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_013om9F5FGh2mr1T26H7k8kX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HJvLWdLtZDynWjm25iNsPi","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/amirfish/Apps/video-claw/scripts/review_room_assemble.py","old_string":"CLIPS = WORK / \"clips\"\nfor d in (WORK, CLIPS):\n    d.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)","new_string":"CLIPS = WORK / \"clips\"\n# Phase-2 motion clips (image-to-video). A \"still\" shot auto-upgrades to its\n# motion clip when present here; otherwise it falls back to the Ken-Burns still.\nMOTION_DIR = RR / \"motion\" / \"codex\"\nfor d in (WORK, CLIPS):\n    d.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3029,"cache_read_input_tokens":596702,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3029},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8372a238-b04e-409c-9415-57d1f26ec648","uuid":"c1419820-1ba5-4a03-ba67-47968027cce0","request_id":"req_011Cbbp5T575oYupHLtRG7Wa"}
